WEBVTT

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:12.680
Roar!

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:16.790
Mr. Monster, your face has...

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:24.240
Noel-chan?

00:00:25.710 --> 00:00:26.550
Koharu!

00:00:26.550 --> 00:00:27.890
Look!

00:00:27.890 --> 00:00:29.130
Mr. Monster is...

00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:31.650
Mr. Monster is sick!

00:00:32.670 --> 00:00:33.640
"Sick?"

00:00:40.330 --> 00:00:41.640
Don't worry about it.

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:46.460
He was getting a bit old, so I was thinking of replacing him with a new one anyway.

00:00:46.460 --> 00:00:47.440
But...

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:49.210
Koharu!

00:00:49.810 --> 00:00:51.540
What're you doing?

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:53.460
We're leaving!

00:00:54.060 --> 00:00:56.460
Thanks for coming to pick me up.

00:00:56.960 --> 00:00:58.010
Morning.

00:00:58.010 --> 00:00:59.040
Good morning.

00:01:00.010 --> 00:01:01.820
Noel!

00:01:01.820 --> 00:01:02.820
Oh I know!

00:01:02.820 --> 00:01:04.540
Noel, do you wanna come too?

00:01:06.040 --> 00:01:07.390
Sorry.

00:01:08.060 --> 00:01:09.180
Noel can't...

00:01:09.180 --> 00:01:11.390
What? C'mon!

00:01:11.390 --> 00:01:13.740
I already asked her, but...

00:01:13.740 --> 00:01:17.120
Man, I keep getting rejected.

00:01:17.120 --> 00:01:19.940
Noel wants to stay here with Mr. Monster!

00:01:20.790 --> 00:01:22.890
Mr... Monster?

00:03:11.950 --> 00:03:13.600
Thanks a lot!

00:03:13.600 --> 00:03:15.020
We're really grateful!

00:03:15.290 --> 00:03:16.770
Sure, no problem.

00:03:16.770 --> 00:03:18.130
It's on my way to work after all.

00:03:18.130 --> 00:03:20.140
Stop trying to look cool!

00:03:21.380 --> 00:03:23.650
All right, I'll be going then.

00:03:24.070 --> 00:03:24.610
Right.

00:03:27.330 --> 00:03:29.380
Hurry up, guys!

00:03:46.510 --> 00:03:47.840
Aren't you going to sit down?

00:03:48.180 --> 00:03:49.680
I'd be wasting a perfect opportunity!

00:03:49.680 --> 00:03:53.350
I've never been out this way before, and I wanna enjoy this!

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:56.670
There isn't much time for us third-years to muck around and have fun!

00:03:56.670 --> 00:03:59.480
We haven't even decided what we're doing for the Hokubi Festival.

00:03:59.480 --> 00:04:01.500
You got any ideas, Nonoka?

00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:02.580
Me?

00:04:03.040 --> 00:04:03.860
Hm...

00:04:04.220 --> 00:04:05.120
Cows!

00:04:11.260 --> 00:04:13.240
She's acting just like she did when she was little.

00:04:13.640 --> 00:04:14.640
Yeah, you're right,

00:04:15.340 --> 00:04:19.700
but you know,
I think you're the same way, too.

00:04:19.700 --> 00:04:20.750
Me?

00:04:21.050 --> 00:04:21.580
Yup.

00:04:22.360 --> 00:04:24.750
You're always dragging Yuzuki around with you,

00:04:24.750 --> 00:04:26.550
and out of all of us, you were the most grown-up.

00:04:26.900 --> 00:04:28.500
I wasn't at all!

00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:29.780
I'm not...

00:04:30.980 --> 00:04:33.530
But maybe you saw me that way because...

00:04:33.530 --> 00:04:35.060
It's 'cause of your glasses!

00:04:35.060 --> 00:04:38.060
I bet I'd look mature if I wore them too!

00:04:41.470 --> 00:04:43.060
I thought you wanted to look at the scenery?

00:04:43.610 --> 00:04:47.350
I gotta space it out so I don't get tired of it!

00:04:49.360 --> 00:04:52.490
Man, I wish Noel and Shione had come too.

00:04:52.900 --> 00:04:54.990
Wait, Togawa-san?

00:04:54.990 --> 00:04:56.870
Oh? I didn't say so?

00:04:56.870 --> 00:04:59.500
I invited Shione to come, but...

00:05:00.060 --> 00:05:01.830
"I already made plans for that day."

00:05:02.480 --> 00:05:04.670
"I've had them for years now."

00:05:04.950 --> 00:05:06.520
and other stuff like that.

00:05:06.520 --> 00:05:07.580
Right...

00:05:08.280 --> 00:05:09.350
I see.

00:05:09.350 --> 00:05:11.170
I bet she was just making stuff up.

00:05:11.520 --> 00:05:13.260
She just doesn't wanna admit it.

00:05:20.010 --> 00:05:22.900
Pain, pain...

00:05:22.900 --> 00:05:24.020
go away!

00:05:33.940 --> 00:05:35.570
Ow...

00:05:38.320 --> 00:05:39.770
Mr. Monster!

00:05:40.460 --> 00:05:42.130
I'm so sorry!

00:05:43.630 --> 00:05:45.500
It's all Noel's fault...

00:05:46.160 --> 00:05:48.590
Mr. Monster!

00:05:48.990 --> 00:05:51.950
"Ow... It hurts so much..."

00:05:51.950 --> 00:05:55.720
"My tummy hurts so much I think I might die!"

00:05:56.470 --> 00:05:58.930
I-I'm sorry!

00:05:58.930 --> 00:06:01.350
Don't die, Mr. Monster!

00:06:01.350 --> 00:06:04.770
Please! Don't leave me!

00:06:06.680 --> 00:06:08.630
Calm down, it's all right.

00:06:08.630 --> 00:06:10.230
I'm sorry, I was just—

00:06:10.710 --> 00:06:13.450
All because of Noel, Mr. Monster is...

00:06:13.450 --> 00:06:15.480
No, I just told you...

00:06:16.820 --> 00:06:18.120
Right?

00:06:18.120 --> 00:06:20.360
I was kidding.

00:06:20.360 --> 00:06:22.610
It was just me messing with you.

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:25.730
O-Okay then.

00:06:25.730 --> 00:06:27.420
I'll help you make him feel all better, okay?

00:06:30.270 --> 00:06:31.570
Really?

00:06:34.830 --> 00:06:36.760
What the heck is this?!

00:06:36.760 --> 00:06:38.770
Looks like we missed it.

00:06:39.890 --> 00:06:41.910
We're in the middle of nowhere!

00:06:41.910 --> 00:06:44.140
<i>And</i> we're supposed to wait here for another hour?

00:06:44.760 --> 00:06:46.220
There's nothing we can do about it.

00:06:46.220 --> 00:06:48.460
I know that, but I still don't like it.

00:06:48.460 --> 00:06:50.960
Didn't you say that you wanted to space out the fun earlier?

00:06:50.960 --> 00:06:53.320
That's totally not what I was talking about!

00:06:53.320 --> 00:06:55.920
I wish there was at least somewhere we could sit down...

00:06:55.920 --> 00:06:57.660
Oh, I know!

00:06:59.250 --> 00:07:01.280
You had something like this stashed away?

00:07:01.280 --> 00:07:03.830
I figured we'd need it for when we have lunch!

00:07:04.200 --> 00:07:06.240
Huh? You want to eat lunch here?

00:07:06.240 --> 00:07:07.990
Why not? It's perfect timing!

00:07:07.990 --> 00:07:09.100
Yes, it is.

00:07:17.170 --> 00:07:18.670
Look at mine!

00:07:18.670 --> 00:07:20.450
Wow, that's amazing!

00:07:20.450 --> 00:07:21.970
It looks delicious.

00:07:22.330 --> 00:07:23.530
I know, right?

00:07:23.530 --> 00:07:26.510
There's a little bit of each of our store's best dishes in these!

00:07:26.510 --> 00:07:28.850
Oh, so you didn't make it yourself.

00:07:29.200 --> 00:07:31.130
Well, it was Mom who made it,

00:07:31.130 --> 00:07:33.880
but <i>I</i> put it all together nicely in the end, okay?

00:07:33.880 --> 00:07:36.360
All right. Calm down.

00:07:37.450 --> 00:07:42.370
Oh yeah, we've done this sort of picnic thing before, haven't we?

00:07:42.970 --> 00:07:44.270
You mean at the observatory?

00:07:44.270 --> 00:07:45.440
Yup.

00:07:45.440 --> 00:07:49.120
I remember you were the only one who'd forgotten to bring their lunch.

00:07:49.680 --> 00:07:54.910
Nonoka got everyone to give a little bit of their lunch to me!

00:07:54.910 --> 00:07:57.600
But then Nonoka got carried away with it,

00:07:57.600 --> 00:08:00.800
and in the end, I wound up with the most extravagant looking lunch!

00:08:00.800 --> 00:08:02.240
Yup, you did!

00:08:02.240 --> 00:08:03.090
Right, Nonoka?

00:08:03.650 --> 00:08:04.940
Huh?

00:08:04.940 --> 00:08:05.720
Nonoka?

00:08:06.150 --> 00:08:06.970
Eh?

00:08:06.970 --> 00:08:08.000
What's wrong?

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:09.330
Something on your mind?

00:08:09.330 --> 00:08:11.280
Oh, I know.

00:08:11.920 --> 00:08:13.680
It's "love", isn't it?

00:08:14.220 --> 00:08:15.870
No, it's nothing like that at all.

00:08:15.870 --> 00:08:17.490
Oh, that wasn't it?

00:08:17.860 --> 00:08:18.520
Nope.

00:08:19.150 --> 00:08:21.240
C'mon, let's just eat.

00:08:27.560 --> 00:08:30.330
Is Mr. Monster going to feel better again?

00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:33.000
We'll work something out.

00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:34.500
Yay!

00:08:39.190 --> 00:08:42.680
I think he's feeling better already,
seeing how much you're worried about him.

00:08:43.260 --> 00:08:45.490
Is there anything Noel can do to help?

00:08:45.490 --> 00:08:47.150
Let's see...

00:08:47.150 --> 00:08:50.260
How about you hold his hand down so he doesn't move about?

00:08:50.260 --> 00:08:50.940
Okay!

00:08:55.320 --> 00:08:56.850
Hey, shorty...

00:08:56.850 --> 00:08:58.200
"Shorty"?

00:08:58.200 --> 00:08:59.500
Noel's name is Noel.

00:08:59.500 --> 00:09:02.410
Why didn't you go with Koharu and the other two?

00:09:02.410 --> 00:09:03.450
They invited you, didn't they?

00:09:04.320 --> 00:09:05.650
It's too far.

00:09:05.650 --> 00:09:06.200
Huh?

00:09:06.830 --> 00:09:09.450
I can't see the Disc if I'm that far away.

00:09:09.810 --> 00:09:10.640
What?

00:09:11.280 --> 00:09:14.500
Wouldn't that mean you can't go farther than the edge of town?

00:09:16.810 --> 00:09:19.100
Come on, hold him down, Noel.

00:09:19.100 --> 00:09:21.760
Y-Yup!

00:09:47.150 --> 00:09:48.490
Are we there?

00:09:50.560 --> 00:09:51.520
Mom...

00:10:03.420 --> 00:10:04.260
Guys, over here!

00:10:08.780 --> 00:10:09.760
See?

00:10:10.120 --> 00:10:11.870
What do you mean, "see?"

00:10:11.870 --> 00:10:13.690
Don't just leave me with one word like that.

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:16.690
Not you too, Nonoka!

00:10:17.360 --> 00:10:19.010
I mean, come on! This place is huge.

00:10:19.010 --> 00:10:20.690
How much further do we have to walk?

00:10:21.160 --> 00:10:23.210
I think we're almost there.

00:10:24.000 --> 00:10:26.050
We're going the right way though, right?

00:10:26.050 --> 00:10:28.450
Yeah. I'm following the directions on this map.

00:10:28.770 --> 00:10:29.530
Map?

00:10:30.130 --> 00:10:34.390
I'm looking for this landmark, but I don't see it yet.

00:10:35.180 --> 00:10:37.460
I'll call Dad and ask him about it.

00:10:37.770 --> 00:10:40.120
Oh? Didn't we pass this already?

00:10:40.120 --> 00:10:40.940
We did?

00:10:40.940 --> 00:10:41.570
Yup!

00:10:42.080 --> 00:10:45.970
Don't worry Nonoka, I got this!

00:10:49.430 --> 00:10:52.610
I guess we'll leave it to her, then.

00:10:52.610 --> 00:10:53.430
Sure.

00:11:00.360 --> 00:11:01.480
Eh?

00:11:01.950 --> 00:11:04.390
This... isn't it.

00:11:05.290 --> 00:11:07.790
N-No, I'm pretty sure it is!

00:11:07.790 --> 00:11:10.240
We should go in and see to make sure!

00:11:11.000 --> 00:11:12.170
Wait!

00:11:13.470 --> 00:11:14.760
Guys, wait for me!

00:11:16.020 --> 00:11:18.030
That should do it for now.

00:11:18.030 --> 00:11:20.520
Is Mr. Monster all better now?

00:11:20.520 --> 00:11:22.290
I've done the best I can for him.

00:11:22.290 --> 00:11:24.260
So it doesn't hurt for him anymore?

00:11:24.710 --> 00:11:26.510
Hm, I guess it's not quite done yet.

00:11:26.510 --> 00:11:27.260
Huh?

00:11:27.600 --> 00:11:30.760
All right. Time for some more surgery.

00:11:31.680 --> 00:11:33.490
Are we here for real this time?

00:11:33.490 --> 00:11:35.300
Yeah, I'm pretty sure this is it.

00:11:35.300 --> 00:11:37.270
We finally made it!

00:11:37.760 --> 00:11:41.020
In the end, it was all Yuzuki's fault that we got lost.

00:11:41.690 --> 00:11:44.240
Save your lectures for later please...

00:11:44.240 --> 00:11:45.970
You can take a break; I'll go fetch some water.

00:11:45.970 --> 00:11:47.190
I'll give you a hand!

00:11:55.820 --> 00:11:57.810
There <i>is</i> something on your mind, isn't there?

00:11:59.010 --> 00:12:02.740
Sorry for forcing myself on you like this.
Would you prefer if I gave you some space?

00:12:03.430 --> 00:12:06.170
No, it's not like that.

00:12:10.580 --> 00:12:14.680
The truth is, I've been scared of coming here to see Mom for a while.

00:12:15.510 --> 00:12:17.490
Even now, I'm still a little frightened.

00:12:18.720 --> 00:12:21.890
If it hadn't been for you guys saying that you wanted to go see her,

00:12:21.890 --> 00:12:23.970
I don't think I would be here right now.

00:12:23.970 --> 00:12:25.080
Why not?

00:12:26.070 --> 00:12:31.230
I mean, I've only seen her in your photos, but she seemed like such a nice mom...

00:12:31.850 --> 00:12:34.950
Yeah, she really was a kind person.

00:12:35.940 --> 00:12:39.230
So kind, always with a smile on her face...

00:12:40.350 --> 00:12:44.030
When she hugged me, I felt so warm.

00:12:44.870 --> 00:12:45.920
But...

00:12:46.400 --> 00:12:48.920
Her hands in mine always felt so cold.

00:12:49.740 --> 00:12:52.680
Seven years ago, just after we left town,

00:12:53.030 --> 00:12:56.850
I was told that we'd moved so we could take better care of Mom's health.

00:12:57.960 --> 00:13:00.290
But in the end, Mom...

00:13:01.340 --> 00:13:02.230
passed away.

00:13:05.080 --> 00:13:09.410
I was so sad... and lonely,

00:13:10.250 --> 00:13:12.200
that I couldn't feel anything else around me.

00:13:13.010 --> 00:13:14.390
It was really painful.

00:13:15.480 --> 00:13:19.200
I think that's when I started forgetting things.

00:13:19.970 --> 00:13:22.740
Mom's voice... her smile...

00:13:23.380 --> 00:13:26.210
All the time I'd spent with her when we lived together...

00:13:26.750 --> 00:13:29.210
I'd made myself believe it never happened!

00:13:29.630 --> 00:13:33.220
I told that to myself over and over,

00:13:34.950 --> 00:13:38.220
and eventually, my pain disappeared.

00:13:39.060 --> 00:13:40.980
My heart stopped hurting.

00:13:42.530 --> 00:13:46.850
But my memories of you guys disappeared along with that pain.

00:13:47.780 --> 00:13:52.270
Yuzuki, Koharu, Souta, even Noel...

00:13:53.140 --> 00:13:55.740
I even betrayed Shione.

00:13:59.930 --> 00:14:03.730
But those memories came back to you again, didn't they?

00:14:03.730 --> 00:14:04.390
Isn't that—

00:14:04.390 --> 00:14:05.420
No!

00:14:05.910 --> 00:14:09.550
I'm sure that Mom hates me for the person I've become!

00:14:10.140 --> 00:14:13.050
There's no way she's proud of a daughter like me now!

00:14:13.500 --> 00:14:18.690
What if she never loved me like that to begin with?

00:14:21.110 --> 00:14:24.200
Then why did you come here, Nonoka?

00:14:24.200 --> 00:14:25.060
Huh?

00:14:25.610 --> 00:14:29.080
She's right. You came to see your mom, didn't you?

00:14:29.080 --> 00:14:32.320
That means that you're ready to work out your problems with her, doesn't it?

00:14:33.380 --> 00:14:36.320
Just like me... and Souta.

00:14:38.420 --> 00:14:40.830
You don't have anything to worry about, Nonoka.

00:14:41.460 --> 00:14:42.080
But...

00:14:42.080 --> 00:14:43.830
No buts.

00:14:44.380 --> 00:14:46.540
I won't hear any more out of you.

00:14:46.540 --> 00:14:49.620
I mean, ever since those days we spent at the observatory,

00:14:49.620 --> 00:14:52.280
you became the person I took the most pride in calling "a friend".

00:14:53.930 --> 00:14:55.010
Thank you.

00:14:55.920 --> 00:14:56.820
But...

00:14:56.820 --> 00:14:58.270
Can you just...

00:14:58.990 --> 00:15:01.820
give me a little more time?

00:15:01.820 --> 00:15:02.420
Sure!

00:15:03.110 --> 00:15:04.670
We'll wait for you up there.

00:15:18.580 --> 00:15:20.410
It's snowing already?

00:15:33.930 --> 00:15:34.790
It's beautiful.

00:15:35.990 --> 00:15:37.430
They're like stars.

00:15:42.330 --> 00:15:44.180
It's falling pretty heavily.

00:15:46.630 --> 00:15:47.190
Huh?

00:15:48.090 --> 00:15:49.280
Shione?

00:15:55.390 --> 00:15:57.570
It's you, isn't it, Shione?

00:16:01.010 --> 00:16:04.580
Oh, so you decided to come after all!

00:16:05.190 --> 00:16:07.040
But... why?

00:16:08.810 --> 00:16:09.960
Wait!

00:16:10.490 --> 00:16:12.040
Nonoka's here too.

00:16:12.750 --> 00:16:14.080
So?

00:16:14.080 --> 00:16:16.930
Why don't you go talk to her like you used to?

00:16:33.450 --> 00:16:34.620
Isn't this...

00:16:34.620 --> 00:16:35.300
Yeah.

00:16:36.130 --> 00:16:37.240
Shione...

00:16:38.700 --> 00:16:39.650
Nonoka!

00:16:41.310 --> 00:16:42.160
Nonoka!

00:16:42.830 --> 00:16:44.030
Just now, Shione—

00:16:44.030 --> 00:16:44.670
Huh?

00:16:47.090 --> 00:16:48.370
Togawa-san!

00:16:48.370 --> 00:16:50.550
We're all going to meet up at the lake tonight

00:16:50.550 --> 00:16:51.500
and look at the stars!

00:16:52.090 --> 00:16:53.750
You should come too, Shione!

00:16:59.070 --> 00:17:02.720
Did Shione know your mother back then?

00:17:02.720 --> 00:17:03.430
Yeah.

00:17:04.270 --> 00:17:08.470
Mom was the one who helped us become friends.

00:17:25.590 --> 00:17:28.140
"If you really want to be her friend..."

00:17:29.850 --> 00:17:31.710
Then you gotta smile more!

00:17:39.390 --> 00:17:41.460
Then what're you making that face for?

00:17:42.580 --> 00:17:43.610
C'mon!

00:17:43.610 --> 00:17:45.050
Yuzuki...

00:17:45.050 --> 00:17:49.590
I remember when you used to smile all the time!

00:17:49.590 --> 00:17:53.380
I bet your mom wants to see that smile of yours now, too!

00:17:58.740 --> 00:18:01.310
Do you think this will make Mr. Monster happy?

00:18:01.680 --> 00:18:04.230
Yup, I'm sure he's really thankful of you.

00:18:04.230 --> 00:18:05.750
"I'm so happy," y'know?

00:18:05.750 --> 00:18:08.130
I bet this will make Koharu happy, too.

00:18:08.790 --> 00:18:13.070
Koharu's not going to get another Mr. Monster now, is she?

00:18:13.530 --> 00:18:15.380
Of course she's not.

00:18:15.380 --> 00:18:17.820
But Koharu said...

00:18:18.550 --> 00:18:21.410
Kirigon here is special to her.

00:18:21.720 --> 00:18:23.160
"Special?"

00:18:23.570 --> 00:18:26.420
It means that she loves Kirigon with all her heart.

00:18:29.230 --> 00:18:30.270
Wait!

00:18:32.120 --> 00:18:34.780
I want to ask the two of you for a favor.

00:18:36.190 --> 00:18:37.160
Here!

00:18:38.490 --> 00:18:42.290
Yuzuki drew out the figure, I cut it out from the board,

00:18:42.290 --> 00:18:45.040
and all three of us coloured it in.

00:18:46.780 --> 00:18:48.690
You did it all together!

00:18:49.840 --> 00:18:54.320
I got so far because you were there supporting me with your smile.

00:18:54.660 --> 00:19:00.800
That's got to be proof that you were always keeping your mother's words in your heart.

00:19:02.320 --> 00:19:04.100
Come on, go for it!

00:19:04.760 --> 00:19:05.910
Here you go.

00:19:09.540 --> 00:19:10.620
Mom,

00:19:12.100 --> 00:19:13.590
I'm here.

00:19:15.930 --> 00:19:17.860
She should be there by now.

00:19:19.140 --> 00:19:21.850
Sorry I'm not there with her.

00:19:22.250 --> 00:19:25.430
I thought she should have you to herself this year.

00:19:33.830 --> 00:19:35.890
My name's Komiya Nonoka!

00:19:35.890 --> 00:19:38.440
Please be my friend!

00:19:58.220 --> 00:20:00.040
This is from Dad.

00:20:03.970 --> 00:20:06.240
He said he's sorry he couldn't come because of work.

00:20:10.590 --> 00:20:12.200
Happy birthday.

00:20:13.860 --> 00:20:15.050
I'll be back soon.

00:20:22.990 --> 00:20:25.700
Thank you, Mom.

00:20:54.760 --> 00:20:56.320
Thank you very much!

00:21:01.210 --> 00:21:02.980
Um, I...

00:21:03.730 --> 00:21:05.920
Sure, go ahead.

00:21:13.470 --> 00:21:14.840
Welcome back!

00:21:14.840 --> 00:21:16.210
Welcome to our store!

00:21:16.520 --> 00:21:17.710
Noel?!

00:21:17.710 --> 00:21:18.710
What's going on?

00:21:19.160 --> 00:21:20.700
I'm returning Souta's favor.

00:21:20.700 --> 00:21:22.910
Oh, you guys are back?

00:21:22.910 --> 00:21:24.720
I-Is that...

00:21:25.110 --> 00:21:27.110
Oh yeah, that.

00:21:27.110 --> 00:21:29.230
Noel and Souta did our best!

00:21:32.160 --> 00:21:35.230
Well, it might look a bit weird...

00:21:35.660 --> 00:21:38.230
But Mr. Monster's all better now!

00:21:39.010 --> 00:21:40.440
Of course he is.

00:21:40.440 --> 00:21:42.390
This might not be such a bad thing, actually.

00:21:42.390 --> 00:21:43.270
What?

00:21:43.270 --> 00:21:44.240
<i>That's</i> not bad?!

00:21:44.680 --> 00:21:47.050
Not in my mind, and that's really all that matters.

00:21:47.050 --> 00:21:48.190
But still...

00:21:48.740 --> 00:21:50.570
I mean, I'm...

00:21:50.570 --> 00:21:52.470
the sign girl, after all!

00:21:55.890 --> 00:21:57.420
Meteor shower?

00:21:58.030 --> 00:21:58.960
Yes.

00:21:58.960 --> 00:22:00.610
There's still some time until it happens,

00:22:00.610 --> 00:22:03.420
but on that night, you'll be able to see countless shooting stars!

00:22:06.180 --> 00:22:07.980
Would you like to take a look too, Shione-chan?

00:22:15.950 --> 00:22:17.440
It's pretty!

00:22:17.950 --> 00:22:21.120
And the meteor shower is going to be even shinier?

00:22:21.120 --> 00:22:21.900
Yup!

00:22:21.900 --> 00:22:24.420
Let's watch it together, okay?

00:22:24.420 --> 00:22:25.450
Yup!

00:22:27.410 --> 00:22:30.450
The stars are looking back at you from afar,

00:22:30.930 --> 00:22:33.460
almost as though they're smiling.

00:22:34.180 --> 00:22:37.220
I bet it's because the two of you are so happy!

00:23:05.090 --> 00:23:06.740
Nonoka!

00:23:10.140 --> 00:23:11.060
Noel...

00:23:11.490 --> 00:23:12.700
Where's Shione?

00:23:14.650 --> 00:23:15.690
I see...

00:23:16.180 --> 00:23:18.450
Shione told Noel to tell you something!

00:23:19.600 --> 00:23:21.800
"I wanted to watch the meteor shower with you."

00:23:22.310 --> 00:23:25.010
I wanted to watch the meteor shower with you.

00:23:31.810 --> 00:23:33.610
Next time, on Sora no Method:

00:23:34.060 --> 00:23:36.030
"What She Believes In."

00:23:36.030 --> 00:23:37.030
Look forward to it!
